+        """Stream transfer rows from the JSON list format written by _save_transfers_callback.
+
+        Older hardening streamed newline-separated rows, but a minified large
+        transfer file can be one giant line. Use JSONDecoder.raw_decode() so we
+        yield one top-level array item at a time without json.load() and without
+        requiring line boundaries between rows.
+        """
